I go to the reception desk.
A staff member is there.
I say to him, "Hello, sir."
"I am new here."
"Can I play here today?"
He says, "Yes, madam, you can play as a guest."
"The entry fee for guests is two hundred rupees."
I give him two hundred rupees.
Then I say, "I do not have a racket with me."
"Can you give a racket on rent?"
He says, "Certainly."
"Its fee is fifty rupees."
I give him fifty rupees too.
He gives me a racket.
I check its weight with my hand.
It is very good.
I am ready now.
Now I go to the court.
